Fonts
-----

The app bundles these fonts (core/design/fonts):

- Noto Sans 2.015, Regular, Medium and Bold, for all text:
  https://github.com/notofonts/latin-greek-cyrillic
  SIL Open Font License 1.1 (core/design/fonts/OFL.txt),
  Copyright 2022 The Noto Project Authors
- Symbols Nerd Font 3.5.1, cut down at build time to the icons Kimono uses:
  https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts
  Patched fonts under the SIL Open Font License 1.1, the Nerd Fonts project
  under the MIT License, Copyright (c) 2014 Ryan L McIntyre
- Material Design Icons (the icons Kimono uses so far), by Pictogrammers:
  https://github.com/Templarian/MaterialDesign-Font, Apache License 2.0
- Font Awesome Free icons, included in the source font:
  https://fontawesome.com, CC BY 4.0, by Fonticons, Inc.

